      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The only mobile solution is using Keyboard asset. This is still more readable and can be found on VRCmods site. You can make 2nd avatar for it until they made it better, then you can switch back to finger trail avatar.\n\nThere are no other solutions for mobile writing / communication, and TTS might other option to speak (not advised for bad hearing / deaf people, TTS will only cause more misunderstandings thinking they can hear what you talk.)\nOnly if you can still hear good, TTS is okay.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
