      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have checked network IK again in build 801, and what is the result? Almost nothing useful, still too bad to read it.\nI can see the tracking speed (more data feed) is bit raised, but... it's still too weak for finger writing.\nAnd room pencils are also still bad, look at the pictures.\nYou must write very slow or write in BIG LETTERS.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
